Slide 15 — Offline vs Simulation Gap
	•	Metrics disagree systematically:
	•	T2: best safety (TTC, collisions), lower progress
	•	T3: best overall simulation score
	•	T4: best offline metrics, worse simulation
	•	T6: worst offline, best projected simulation

Why:
	•	Offline:
	•	Frame-averaged
	•	No rule enforcement
	•	Simulation:
	•	Penalises violations
	•	Evaluates decisions
	•	Rare events dominate simulation score

Conclusion:

Offline metrics useful for debugging, not model comparison

Simulation score is the closest proxy to real-world driving performance

